              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Beryl's Main Gimmick is \"Retaining Cards\"\nRetain cards are not discarded at the end of the turn\nRetain cards can have an activated effect that happens if they're saved\nOpening Found 5 (The Upgrade)\nONLY ACTIVATES ON END OF TURN RETAIN\nGuilty Pleasure 4, Growth Accel 1, Will of Light do not Activate it\nGuilty Pleasure 4 only affects Beryl Cards\nWill of Light only affects Orlea Cards (?)\nGrowth Accel 1 is the only version that can target allies, AKA Beryl to Combo"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
