    {
      "id": "rosaria-daisy-nakia-ritochika",
      "title": {
        "en": "Rosaria | Daisy | Nakia | Ritochika"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Rosaria: is god\nDaisy: Beats Nakia if you have max dupes\nNakia: Don't go this over Rosaria\nRitochika: 3 EP Ego Skill (Technically Rosaria can generate this much each time, but its RNG)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Solia | Marin"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Solia: If you go AFK Retain, then Solia rises up in Value, Rosaria wins if she can gen Moral tho\nMarin: You mainly play her for her Ego Skill to pull Guilty Pleasure, 3 EP to Tutor is great\nAlso she requires dupes to reach the same Atk%"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
