            "en": "Ego Manifestation"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nHeavy Weapon Specialist to 0 Cost, VERY GOOD\nE2:\nAll Retain cards get +20% Damage, Good\nE3:\nPotential Levels: It's ok\nE4:\nIncreases Ego Skill damage, it's ok\nE5:\nPotential Levels: It's ok\nE6:\nWhen Retaining a card, you charge up an \"Extra Attack\" Good free damage"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "notable-refinements",
      "title": {
        "en": "Notable Refinements:"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Increase Damage Amount of Attack Cards by 20%"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "At the start of battle, if owning 18 or less cards, increase Damage Amount of Attack Cards by 30%"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Increase Damage Amount of 2-Cost or higher Attack Cards by 25%"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "When an Attack Card is activated on a target in a Vulnerable state, +15% Critical Chance"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "At the start of battle, Draw 1 Exhaust card(s) of this unit"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "At the start of the turn, if an Exhaust card is in Draw Pile, have a 30% chance to Draw 1 Exhaust card"
          }
        }
      ]
