    {
      "id": "part-8",
      "title": {
        "en": "Part 8"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Spores are very good at triggering opening found\nAnd you could use Guilty 4 to create a ton\nMushroom Ammo + Guilty 4 + Spore is a funny idea, but the ratios aren't that high\nNutrient: Helps exhaust Forgotten Grave\nAzure: Ig it exists to exaust stuff"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Beryl basics aren't very good\nSpecialist: Creates you fodder for Opening Found Upgrade, or is just free damage, good\nHidden Bullet: Just a good Retain Neutral\nQuick Shelling: Cantrips with damage, never bad\nLeap Attack: Quick Shelling but more conditional\nNegotiate: 2 Moral"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Found 1: Extra Hit is good\nFound 2: Can be 0 Cost, but not very nessicary\nFound 3: 2 Extra Hits is very good, but only lasts for 1 turn\nFound 4: Very Weak Scaling compared to Found 1 or 3\nFound 5: Upgrade End of Turn Spam Beryl\nIt turns out even though it's non Visual Unique% Potential Increases Upgrade Damage\nNot sure about Unique Stat"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "6/5"
