              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany V"
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Guilty 1: 0 AP Draw 3, then 1 Permanent Moral, Very good\nGuilty 2: Cost Reduction unimportant\nGuilty 3: Delayed Draw 2, it's ok\nGuilty 4: Activates Beryl only retain, not allies, it's ok since it Cantrips, not card positive\nGuilty 5: Unique, 0 AP Draw 3, good for Run and to not dupe it, it's ok\nMoral Neutral Epiphany is great, AP or Draw are also very good"
          }
        },
